WEBVTT

00:03:57.722 --> 00:04:00.694
that a hundred years ago,
their families came out

00:04:00.694 --> 00:04:03.773
of the same place in Northern Africa.

00:04:03.773 --> 00:04:06.848
This is not a photo profile
for your Facebook.

00:04:06.848 --> 00:04:08.682
This is not disaster tourism.

00:04:08.682 --> 00:04:11.050
This is the future of travel,

00:04:11.050 --> 00:04:14.114
and I invite you to join me to do that,
to change your travel.

00:04:14.114 --> 00:04:16.065
We're doing it all over the world now,

00:04:16.065 --> 00:04:18.503
from Ireland to Iran to Turkey,

00:04:18.503 --> 00:04:21.499
and we see ourselves going
everywhere to change the world.

00:04:21.499 --> 00:04:22.729
Thank you.

00:04:22.729 --> 00:04:24.633
(Applause)